Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 02:37:06 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 068/230] Fix A-ADS bot: make static ad visible, drop React ad
 duplicates

- index.html: remove display:none from the AADS wrapper so the bot sees a
  visible banner; add margin/padding/max-width/positioning so it renders at
  the bottom without being covered by the fixed bottom nav.
- Matches.tsx + MatchDetail.tsx: remove the <AdBanner /> import and usage
  since the static HTML ad is now the single source of truth. This avoids
  duplicate ads and keeps the React side out of the ad injection path.

Gates: typecheck, lint, format, tests, build.
